{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>הוי</b> — the exile will lengthen and endure until this kingdom of Javan is cut off, until its appointed end comes." "<b>חרב על זרועו על עין ימינו</b> — the sense of זרוע is strength, that he be chastised, and the עין is the eye of wisdom, and the counsel — and behold, his mighty ones and his wise men will perish."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:49.745663643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}